This repository contains proprietary tooling for building a custom Android
Open Source Project (AOSP) flavor. Source code in this repository is NOT
licensed for redistribution.

The Android Open Source Project source code that this pipeline downloads
and builds at runtime remains under its original licenses (Apache-2.0 and
others). See https://source.android.com/license for details.

Third-party patterns acknowledged:
  - Volume layout and env-var-driven entrypoint patterns are inspired by
    lineageos4microg/docker-lineage-cicd (Apache-2.0).
  - Cuttlefish runtime tooling is provided by google/android-cuttlefish
    (Apache-2.0).
  - The Dockerfile draws on alexanderwolz/aosp-docker (Apache-2.0) and
    cdlee/aosp-builder.

